## 7. Success criteria

| # | Criterion | How it's verified |
|---|---|---|
| S1 | Runs 14 days unattended with no data gap longer than one hour | Inspect day shards for missing sample windows |
| S2 | Correctly catches a deliberate outage | Pause a Vercel project; board goes red within 30 min |
| S3 | `main` branch history contains no cron commits | `git log main --oneline \| wc -l` stays proportional to real work |
| S4 | Board loads in under 1s on a cold cache | Lighthouse / network panel |
| S5 | Health checker reproduces the known Monday `description` failure | Compare Tuesday's `health.json` against a manual spot-check of 5 repos |
| S6 | A stopped cron is visible as stale, not as green | Disable the workflow for an hour; confirm the banner appears |
| S7 | No secret, identity value, or file path appears in any file on the `data` branch | Grep the branch before going public |

