| # | Deliverable | Effort |
|---|---|---|
| M0 | Repo, SHELL-compliant baseline, orphan `data` branch, type contracts | 0.5 day |
| M1 | Actions cron: probe targets, append shards, maintain summary, prune | 1 day |
| M2 | Static board: rows, 90-day strip, status pill, staleness banner | 1.5 days |
| M3 | Latency stats, neobrutalist pass, perf budget | 0.5 day |
| M4 | Health checker + compliance table + trend | 1.5 days |

**~3.5 days for the uptime half, +1.5 for health.** Shortest build in SPAWN.

theprawnstatus should itself pass every check in `standard.json` before it checks anything else. Dogfooding is M0-1, not a later cleanup.

